            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Ignoring the scoop size</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                BodyTech scoops range from about 29 g to 33 g depending on flavor, and Whey Tech Pro 24 gives 24 g rather than 25 g of protein. Compare products on cost per 25 g of protein, not price per tub or per serving, or the cheaper-looking option may not be cheaper at all.
